  "id": "error-sum-of-squares",
  "term": "error sum of squares",
  "definition": "Error sum of squares is a statistical quantity that adds up squared prediction errors in linear regression. In analysis of variance, it refers to the squared variation not explained by the relevant group means, including the subjects-by-treatment interaction in within-subject designs.",
